{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなー！20歳になったよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー！！\n今までわたしを支えてきてくれた\n皆さんに心から感謝します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日メンバーもお祝いしてくれました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/05/16/2766981/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/05/16/2766981/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなフルーツタルト♥︎\nみんな本当にありがとー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20代は、『のびのび』と♪笑\n1日1日をしっかりと生きていきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20代の桜井玲香のことを\nこれからも支えてください☆\n改めてよろしくお願いします*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日前にはDANGOも一足先に\n誕生会してくれましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/05/16/2766981/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2014/05/16/2766981/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼肉♡笑\nめちゃくちゃ美味しかったので、\nまた行きたい(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭についてるのは、ティアラが\n大好きな友人が用意してくれて、\n半強制的に......(°_°)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、皆さん本当にありがとう！\nあ、明日の生誕祭もとっても楽しみにしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014.05.16"}],"source":"archive"}